ncalayer (1.4.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Run the JVM in the foreground in all launchers instead of backgrounding
    it with a swallowed stderr, so startup errors are visible and the launcher
    process stays alive as the application's main process
  * Remove the dead pkg/ncalayer.spec duplicate; the RHEL and Fedora specs are
    the ones actually built by the Makefile and CI

 -- ZhymabekRoman <robanokssamit@yandex.kz>  Mon, 28 Sep 2026 05:03:48 +0500

ncalayer (1.4.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Packaging-only fix release; no change to the contents of this package
  * The official ncalayer.zip ships its bundled JRE directory as 0700, which
    made the AppImage and the Fedora RPM unusable by non-root users
  * Fix the build-arch CI job so tagged releases publish again

 -- ZhymabekRoman <robanokssamit@yandex.kz>  Mon, 28 Sep 2026 04:47:45 +0500

